{"server":"cn","storyId":"act9d0_level_act9d0_02_end","groupId":"act9d0","stageId":"act9d0_02","title":"偶然","storyCode":"DM-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"d59cccd4ea7ed5729828d18f68ff3d9310b8f1f75b3dcc597a773e69dcb13f5c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡兹戴尔北面，有一片桦树林。\n那里属于生命的时间，从春天开始，到入冬结束。\n而漫长的隆冬只有死亡，所有生命都不约而同地离开那里，只有裸露在地表上的源石结晶反射着月光。\n......灰白色的树干，细长的影子在雪地上交叉重叠，了无生气。\n那就是我看到的景色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n......伊内丝！\n......伊内丝！啧！\n......该死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果可以醒过来，就麻烦你早点醒过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（头......好痛......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"现在是......什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么情况，不过为了防止你刚才摔到失忆，我可以提醒你一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"一个小时前我们遭到伏击，敌人很迅速，术师来不及构筑法术工事，队伍被打散了，附近就我们两个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"被干扰了，不知道什么手段，对方很专业，比以往任何一个猎物都要专业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不过好消息是，对方没有朝着护送目标去，看来他们只是捕风捉影地找到了一点小消息，其实一无所知呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......继续行动，想办法和其他人汇合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀？我还以为你至少会怀疑我两句呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我会把你留下来做活饵哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得现在我和你打，谁会活下来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"当然是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啧——你还真是，性格恶劣，你一眼就确认了我的伤势？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"喔......原来你这么疼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你连自己的情绪波动都能伪装得像模像样，一瞬间担心了一下，看来是多余的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——你醒来第一件事就是用你的源石技艺观察队友吗？还真是充满信任啊，队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"习惯而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原来如此，睁眼的第一刻就要警惕周围，真是个胆小鬼啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过活饵，对吧？是个不错的提议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"带着一个站都站不稳的佣兵行动才是犯蠢，你就留下吧，我会帮你通知周围的敌人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好和他们愉快相处，不要死得太快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"回头见，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"最后说一句，我根本没信任过你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，你这——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......发现佣兵，一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"确认对方代号，W。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，其实你们一直都跟着我们......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"就凭你们这些人的身手，放走一两人根本不足为惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，本想跟着监视你们直到发现本队，没想到竟然抛下同伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"把那支队伍的信息全部告诉我，你可以死得痛快点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这下可麻烦了呀......我其实是很乐意坦诚相待的，但我真的什么都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你受伤不轻，我们时间也不多，仓促的拷问可能致死，对我们都不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你去追那个女人啊，她知道的比我多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......她把你当诱饵，你就不恨她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"和我们合作，痛快得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......诱饵呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你......用工业源石碎屑引诱过源石虫吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"只是卡兹戴尔的一个偏方啦，经常会因为源石虫遇到很多麻烦不是吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"野生的源石虫智力很低，据说会对源石有反应——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——不过真假姑且不论，你知道那些被引诱过来的虫子，会是什么下场吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"别故弄玄虚——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"就会像你埋伏在后方的同伴那样，被炸得稀烂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"什——什么时候！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，都说了是“活饵”了，会没有陷阱吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你该早点下杀手，或者干脆逃跑。现在再给你一次机会，我们重新来一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"——这么快！？原来你们一直在追踪我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你这疯子！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——背后——谁——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"小点声，别乱动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然只是把外行人也挥得动的细剑，但我可不是什么剑术大师，一失手，你就会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你——你什么时候——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我和阴影的亲和力可是很高的，你真的以为一个侦查员都不带就能抓到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"来，告诉我，你的主人是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我——不会——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"轻点，你把别人的五脏六腑都搅翻了还怎么让人说话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔的——不会——原谅你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"（卡兹戴尔......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是完全不擅长拷问啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......真遗憾，你还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可以等他把我解决掉再对他下手的，你也太着急了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，比起你，当然是碾死他们比较优先，这些虫子让我蒙受了多少损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"应当死在我的手下的敌人已经露出破绽，哪一个雇佣兵还按捺得住？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你，还挺像个萨卡兹的不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"耳濡目染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才的动静挺大，应该会吸引不少敌人过来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是正好吗？能让他们远离目标队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"他说放走一两个......就是说其他人都死了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"这种水平根本解决不了那么多同僚，何况他在畏惧，战场上......有别的什么东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的伤，真的是装的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，再怎么说伤口可是实打实的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我没那么在意罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你啊，真的凭醒过来那一眼，就能知道我已经把给他们的小礼物准备好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我没醒，就轮到我作活饵了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定会等到你死了再收网。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有一天，你遇上一个真的能看清你内心思绪的人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你大概不会是她的对手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是哦，那我拭目以待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"开始了，用你的法术再侦测一下附近成不成？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......不用你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"别，你摆这脸色，一般证明我们都没好下场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说的没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"可是逃也逃不掉，硬着头皮上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你不擅长正面作战，那岂不是只有我上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"先往西边走，和赫德雷的队伍汇合之后也许能有转机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"要是没能汇合呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......那我们都活不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"护卫队伍已经歼灭过半，但是，没能在运输队伍抵达A5集合点前拦截住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"诱饵有很多......几支护卫最周全的队伍都只是烟雾弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"要么是巴别塔执意剑走偏锋，要么......是本队根本不需要保护。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，不能再拖了，必须速战速决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"本以为把清扫后续交给那些亡命之徒就够了......没想到他们连这点事都办不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"看来雇佣兵之中水平起伏也很大，赫德雷的小队比想象中要强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"若非被对方先一步找上......也许可以为我们所用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"要继续追？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"可前面也许......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士？","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了，将军，在所不辞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟丢了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"分头去，你们，东边，我西边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这些家伙，好像，的确不太好惹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你说，躲好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"啧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，从刚开始你就没停下过，你会瞎的，眼睛不痛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"废话，痛，但至少得找一条出口——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雇佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咿——咿啊啊——不，不要——我投降——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，清脆利落的劈砍声，看到他们的身手了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"他们只是伪装成雇佣兵而已，他们根本不是什么雇佣兵——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"少说几句！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"就算没有其他埋伏了，光现在能在废墟中确认到身影的这几个家伙，就完全打不赢啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——你想干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"都什么时候了，怎么还要监视我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我只是还没瞎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你抱着那么多......那是弩手的榴弹？你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你想和他们同归于尽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"能杀一个是一个，很正常的想法吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"别送死，这没有意义——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们活着又有什么意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......萨卡兹果然都是疯子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你不是疯子，所以我也从来都不信任你啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，W！等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，回来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，发现一人，W，榜上有名呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"用手投掷爆炸范围如此之大的源石榴弹，真是让人大开眼界的鲁莽方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎么做到的？我的队友一瞬间就被火焰吞没了，你自己倒是没事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，熟能生巧吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......将军会很中意你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"放弃抵抗吧，把巴别塔交给你们的任务悉数告知，你们会有别的地方可以大放光彩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......你凭什么信任我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我凭什么信任你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"很聪明的先后顺序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"雇佣兵是一种战争工具，如果我们要互相竞争，当然是要把顺手的工具掌握在自己手里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，应该是方便的一次性消耗品才对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"随便你怎么想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"还有躲藏在四点钟十七米方向的那个，擅长侦测法术的雇佣兵，你也想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"先把你的刀放下，你没有胜算，当然如果你想试试，也可以。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"那你想怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......情报吻合，W，伊内丝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的队伍已经覆灭近八成，剩下的残兵败将，就像这个人一样，不值一提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脚下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"这些残块曾经是个完整的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了吗？你们面对的不是普通的雇佣兵，也不是什么杀手，刺客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"这样吧，算上你们的领袖，你们三个人，其中任意两个人联手，杀死第三者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"带着任何一个人的头颅回到这里，所有损失和责任都算在那个死人头上，我们会接纳剩下的生还者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"别误会，这并不是我的主意，但我们也要给丧生的战士们一个交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是在战场上招安，也许我们会合作得更加愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......承蒙厚爱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"很不幸，我不擅长战斗，我多半是赢不了这个恶心的女人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"突然很诚实嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，所以剩下的选择，就是我们俩联手，去杀了赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我想听听......雇佣兵们执意送死的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不想站在被戏弄性命的那一方，我觉得还是戏弄别人的性命比较有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我也不太想听你摆布啊，怎么说，你出的这种低级难题也太无聊了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，至于这位眼睛快瞎掉也快气疯掉的小羊羔呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟她不是萨卡兹嘛，你踩到她的雷区了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"——你们知道会是什么下场的，这场仗你们已经打输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"下场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不知道哎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你真的要去吗？舰船已经近在眼前了。\n嗯，没有想到他们这么快就察觉到了，是情报人员的失误吗。\n至少有雇佣兵卫队在。\n我们让那些战士身陷他们所不知情的危险。\n雇佣兵本来就是如此，我们应当......也迟早要背负这些。\n我能救下他们，救下一些会因为我们的失策而不知真相死去的战士。\n......我不否认，特蕾西娅，但是——\n没有任何一个萨卡兹、没有任何一个人，有理由白白牺牲。\n......唉......那我和你一起去。\n嗯，谢谢你——\n——凯尔希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，果然还有援兵吗......这些人到底是什么来头......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人数......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，别吓昏过去啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......保持意识有点......困难......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"你还会说抱歉......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"上次我看着昏倒的你......这次轮到你帮帮忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，别那么小气......我就稍微......休息一会....."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"十四、十五......不，更多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"有序无声，是专业的......不，是比我们还要更加熟悉战场的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡兹戴尔......哼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伊......听......有人.....\n有人......去救......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯......恢复了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是......什么感觉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"有人在靠近......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_battlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"......赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——伊内丝！W呢？你们现在的坐标在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"战争开始前......你在卡兹戴尔......生活过，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道一件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——你受伤了？先稳住气息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"躲在安全的地方，我们已经向运输队本队申请联系援军——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"先......听我说，赫德雷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好的，我在听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹的王......失去了卡兹戴尔的那位......殿下她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_052","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是个......白发的女性？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
